 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+* Footnotes are now numbered and ordered by the order of their first reference
+  in the document rather than by the order of their definitions. A new
+  `USE_DEFINITION_ORDER` option for the footnotes extension restores the
+  previous behavior.
+
 ### Fixed
 
 * Fix handling of incomplete HTML tags in code spans in Python 3.14.
